{"html":"<h1 id=\"core-language-benchmark\">Core language benchmark</h1>\n<p>1 compile runs, 1 fresh-process runs, and 100 raw runtime runs. Values shown as mean ± sample standard deviation in ms. Compile warmups: 1. Process warmups: 1. Raw runtime warmups: 10.</p>\n<p>Matched rows keep the same algorithm. Idiomatic rows allow each ecosystem's normal optimized implementation; inspect the linked source before comparing them.</p>\n<h2 id=\"compile-time-ms\">Compile time (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>idiomatic</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>13940.755 ± 0.000</td><td>83.694 ± 0.000</td><td>100.028 ± 0.000</td><td>120.981 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>matched</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>6.064 ± 0.000</td><td>60.743 ± 0.000</td><td>109.064 ± 0.000</td><td>142.841 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>matched</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>15.558 ± 0.000</td><td>81.768 ± 0.000</td><td>108.513 ± 0.000</td><td>125.761 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>13290.213 ± 0.000</td><td>114.163 ± 0.000</td><td>159.171 ± 0.000</td><td>160.994 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>12706.592 ± 0.000</td><td>106.969 ± 0.000</td><td>164.515 ± 0.000</td><td>168.117 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"runtime-ms\">Runtime (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>idiomatic</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>119.927 ± 0.000</td><td>10.755 ± 0.000</td><td>11.260 ± 0.000</td><td>11.794 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>matched</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>92.807 ± 0.000</td><td>17.323 ± 0.000</td><td>18.002 ± 0.000</td><td>17.089 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>matched</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>44.330 ± 0.000</td><td>3.313 ± 0.000</td><td>3.554 ± 0.000</td><td>3.973 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>256.802 ± 0.000</td><td>28.923 ± 0.000</td><td>29.109 ± 0.000</td><td>28.006 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>223.665 ± 0.000</td><td>27.192 ± 0.000</td><td>25.989 ± 0.000</td><td>24.388 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-internal-compiler-core-time-including-optimizer-ms\">VKF internal compiler-core time, including optimizer (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>13936.892 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>3.354 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>12.931 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>13285.959 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>12702.666 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-empirical-optimizer-time-within-compilation-ms\">VKF empirical optimizer time within compilation (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>0.000 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>0.000 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>0.000 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>0.000 ± 0.000</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>0.000 ± 0.000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"raw-kernel-runtime-ms\">Raw kernel runtime (ms)</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">operation</th><th scope=\"col\">mode</th><th scope=\"col\">data</th><th scope=\"col\">size</th><th scope=\"col\">count</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF</th><th scope=\"col\">C++</th><th scope=\"col\">Rust</th><th scope=\"col\">Zig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spectral norm by power method</td><td>idiomatic</td><td>dense f64 vectors and implicit matrix</td><td>large</td><td>500</td><td>116.201 ± 5.488</td><td>9.251 ± 0.783</td><td>9.079 ± 0.276</td><td>9.110 ± 0.460</td></tr><tr><td>fannkuch-redux permutations</td><td>matched</td><td>fixed integer sequence and indexed mutation</td><td>large</td><td>9</td><td>87.388 ± 2.097</td><td>14.777 ± 0.404</td><td>15.101 ± 0.630</td><td>14.570 ± 0.441</td></tr><tr><td>five-body symplectic integration</td><td>matched</td><td>five bodies with f64 position, velocity, mass, and final kinetic checksum</td><td>large</td><td>50000</td><td>43.991 ± 1.688</td><td>2.015 ± 0.069</td><td>2.011 ± 0.104</td><td>2.494 ± 0.327</td></tr><tr><td>serial combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three matched kernels in one deterministic program</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>245.437 ± 15.826</td><td>26.353 ± 1.504</td><td>26.224 ± 2.296</td><td>25.175 ± 1.365</td></tr><tr><td>parallel combined</td><td>matched</td><td>three independent large kernels; one scalar checksum</td><td>large</td><td>3</td><td>235.664 ± 18.587</td><td>24.968 ± 2.137</td><td>24.947 ± 2.238</td><td>23.607 ± 1.798</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"vkf-raw-kernel-runtime-ratio\">VKF raw-kernel runtime ratio</h2>\n<p>VKF time divided by the peer time on the same pinned CPU; below 1× means VKF is faster.</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"reg